{"unit_id":"lifangjin__dsh-maoying#card-zh","repo":"lifangjin/dsh-maoying","commit":"781c9b96a13b34d43d2b85b760c4cdbcf083cedd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"毛颖 (Maoying) 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的网文创作辅助插件，提供主编与五个专职帮手的写作协作预设，并安装创作方法技能。它同时注册创作台面板，可管理已注册工作区中的章节、章纲、设定和账本，编辑时提供结构校验与外部改动检测。随包提供 maoying CLI，用于初始化书稿、统计章节、重建索引、生成写作卡、静态检查，以及导出 Markdown、TXT 或 EPUB。适合用 DSH 规划和持续创作长篇小说的作者；需要 Node.js 18+ 和 DSH，插件不声明 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:119","index.mjs:1654-1689","index.mjs:1286-1327","bin/maoying.mjs:3-15"]}
{"unit_id":"lifangjin__dsh-maoying#card-en","repo":"lifangjin/dsh-maoying","commit":"781c9b96a13b34d43d2b85b760c4cdbcf083cedd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Maoying is a DSH web plugin for novel writing. It installs a chief-and-five-helpers preset and a panel to manage chapters, outlines, and ledgers. Its CLI initializes projects, builds writing briefs, checks manuscripts, and exports Markdown, TXT, or EPUB. Requires Node.js 18+ and DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:119","index.mjs:1654-1689","index.mjs:1286-1327","bin/maoying.mjs:3-15"]}
